  <h2>What this is</h2>
  <p>
    Self-image is a Motivate category because the research is unambiguous: men who feel
    better about their appearance are more consistent in every other health behavior.
    The relationship is bidirectional — improving body composition improves self-image,
    and improving self-image improves motivation to sustain body composition habits.
  </p>
  <p>
    Beyond body composition, cosmetic and aesthetic options have expanded significantly
    in the last decade. Hair restoration, skin quality, body contouring, and other
    aesthetic interventions are increasingly part of a holistic health picture for men
    in the 35–60 window. My4MLife is building a curated aesthetic consult pathway.
  </p>

